    "text": "The remainder when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>11</mn></mfenced><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1011</mn></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math> is divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> is _____ .",
